                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "A very short and sweet adventure. \n\nI found the supporting cast compelling and fun, and the idea of building up your own little fleet was intriguing.\nCan't complain about the price; I got 6 hours of fun in just one playthrough. \n\nThe only thing I found wanting in this game is the overall length and depth of content. I felt there was a real missed opportunity with this setting. The characters had interesting stuff going on, it just wasn't seen through. We get the idea of owning a fleet, but why not let us have a hand in managing it?\n\nOther COG games have proven it possible to have that kind of depth, it's just a shame we didn't get it here. I recommend it for a short bit of fun, but what you see on a first playthrough is about what you get overall.",
                        "timestamp_created": 1786583770,
